## Evidence boundary

A derivation note can establish an analytic relation within its stated assumptions. It does not by itself validate a numerical implementation, imported physical input, observational model, or manuscript interpretation. Add focused `verification/verify_*.py` scripts when executable identities or benchmarks become reusable or support a promoted project-level claim.
